G1854.def:
**ἔξω **
_adv._ (ἐξ), [in LXX for חוּץ ;]
1. **outside, without**;
(a) **adverbially**: [[Mat.12.46|Mat.12:46]], [[Mrk.3.31; 11.4|Mrk.3:31 11:4]], [[Luk.8.20|Luk.8:20]], [[Jhn.18.16|Jhn.18:16]], al.; with art., ὁ ἔ., he who is without; metaphorically, in pl., οἱ ἔ., of those outside the Church, [[1Co.5.12-13|1Co.5:12-13]], [[Col.4.5|Col.4:5]] (Lft., in l), [[1Th.4.12|1Th.4:12]] ὁ ἔ. ἄνθρωπος, [[2Co.4.16|2Co.4:16]] αἱ ἔ. πόλεις, [[Act.26.11|Act.26:11]]
(b) as prep. with genitive: [[Luk.13.33|Luk.13:33]], [[Act.21.5|Act.21:5]], [[Heb.13.11-12|Heb.13:11-12]]
2. After verbs of motion;
(a) **adverbially, forth, out**: [[Mat.5.13|Mat.5:13]] [[Mrk.14.68|Mrk.14:68]], [[Luk.22.62|Luk.22:62]], [[Jhn.19.4, 13|Jhn.19:4, 13]], [[Act.9.40|Act.9:40]], al.;
(b) as prep. with genitive, **out of**: [[Mat.21.17|Mat.21:17]], [[Mrk.11.19; 12.8|Mrk.11:19 12:8]], [[Luk.4.29|Luk.4:29]], [[Act.7.58|Act.7:58]], [[Heb.13.13|Heb.13:13]], al
(AS)

G1861.def:
**ἐπ-αγγέλλω **
[in LXX: [[Est.4.8|Est.4:8]] (אָמַר), [[Pro.13.12|Pro.13:12]], [[Wis.2.13|Wis.2:13]], al. ;]
1. to announce, proclaim.
2. (a) to promise;
(b) to profess. Mid., also frequently in both these senses;
(with) **to promise**: with dab. of person(s), [[Heb.6.13|Heb.6:13]] with accusative of thing(s), [[Rom.4.21|Rom.4:21]], [[Tit.1.2|Tit.1:2]]; with dative of person(s) and accusative of thing(s), [[Jas.1.12; 2.5|Jas.1:12 2:5]], [[2Pe.2.19|2Pe.2:19]]; ἐπαγγελίαν, [[1Jn.2.25|1Jn.2:25]] with inf., [[Mrk.14.11|Mrk.14:11]], [[Act.7.5|Act.7:5]]; before λέγων, [[Heb.12.26|Heb.12:26]] ptcp., [[Heb.10.23; 11.11|Heb.10:23 11:11]];
(d) **to profess**: θεοσέβειαν, [[1Ti.2.10|1Ti.2:10]] γνῶσιν, [[1Ti.6.21|1Ti.6:21]] Pass., [[Gal.3.19|Gal.3:19]] (cf. προ-επαγγέλλω; and see Cremer, 26).†
(AS)
